{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tails &amp; Talons is a roguelite deckbuilder where <i>spell-casting cards</i> and <i>card-matching combos</i> intertwine to create an addicting and strategic experience! Join a colorful cast of furry adventurers, unleash powerful spells, and chain devastating combos as you descend down a mysterious tower..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/cef7fb3ad563c5581ff1cc10f941ca50.avif?t=1760019072\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras_big/cef7fb3ad563c5581ff1cc10f941ca50.avif?t=1760019072 width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match up elements and runes to rack up bigger numbers when you attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/ab7944e201a5528dfe4f6f4a7b00fb55.poster.avif?t=1760019072\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/ab7944e201a5528dfe4f6f4a7b00fb55.webm?t=1760019072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/ab7944e201a5528dfe4f6f4a7b00fb55.mp4?t=1760019072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/3090a7527d1a47bf5436be647163c7e2.avif?t=1760019072\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras_big/3090a7527d1a47bf5436be647163c7e2.avif?t=1760019072 width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matching-combos aren\u2019t the only way to hit hard \u2013 fill your deck with spells and discover trinkets that synergise with your strategy to grow your power exponentially!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/97b2fc58c7e2f44e10eb5f64f81ce581.poster.avif?t=1760019072\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/97b2fc58c7e2f44e10eb5f64f81ce581.webm?t=1760019072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/97b2fc58c7e2f44e10eb5f64f81ce581.mp4?t=1760019072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/94c9f39a2d0cb1b040d2f491eed349b3.avif?t=1760019072\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras_big/94c9f39a2d0cb1b040d2f491eed349b3.avif?t=1760019072 width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend down into a mysterious subterranean tower where the deeper you go, the stranger things become\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras/dd73c0753f3463074893ad8f6d2d5059.avif?t=1760019072\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667460/extras_big/dd73c0753f3463074893ad8f6d2d5059.avif?t=1760019072 width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_p